{"unit_id":"49zr664rb8-hue__dsh-codex-effort#card-zh","repo":"49zr664rb8-hue/dsh-codex-effort","commit":"9271998023f22a07bdbbdc89ce51fd56f73a7c9f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codex-effort 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型推理等级界面插件。它接管 composer 的模型选择槽位，以可拖拽、可点击并支持键盘调整的滑条呈现当前模型提供的推理档位；档位数据与选择操作仍由 DSH 模型目录负责。用户可切换模型、调整强度、重置默认值，并按会话记住快速模式开关；到达最高档时显示额度消耗提示。适合希望用图形滑条控制模型推理强度的 DSH Web 用户。需要 DSH 提供槽位与模型目录服务，不需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:420-450","client.js:1219-1295"]}
{"unit_id":"49zr664rb8-hue__dsh-codex-effort#card-en","repo":"49zr664rb8-hue/dsh-codex-effort","commit":"9271998023f22a07bdbbdc89ce51fd56f73a7c9f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-codex-effort adds a draggable effort slider to the DSH web composer. It reads levels from DSH’s model directory and saves selections there. Users can adjust effort, switch models, reset the level, and toggle a per-session fast-mode indicator. Requires DSH slot and model-directory services.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:420-450","client.js:1219-1295"]}
